{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10164","city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[44,70,77,83,55,23],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1016205","helmet":"WP1025405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1033002","name":{"zh":"称霸江东","en":"Dominion over Jiangdong"},"year":"196","month":"9","desc":{"zh":"退刘繇、纳名士，江东小霸王的威名传遍江南，如今的小霸王可不会轻易停下脚步...\n\n触发条件：孙策、王朗、严白虎存活。建业属孙策、会稽属王朗、吴属严白虎。\n\n禁忌条件：主角是蒋钦、周泰、陈武、凌操、凌统、严白虎、王朗时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【身属孙策势力】","en":"Having repelled Liu Yao and recruited illustrious scholars, the renown of the Little Conqueror of Jiangdong echoes across the land south of the Yangtze. Now, the Little Conqueror will not easily halt his stride...\n\n\n\nTrigger Condition: Sun Ce, Wang Lang, and Yan Baihu are alive. Jianye belongs to Sun Ce, Huiji belongs to Wang Lang, and Wu belongs to Yan Baihu.\n\n\n\nIncompatible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Jiang Qin, Zhou Tai, Chen Wu, Ling Cao, Ling Tong, Yan Baihu, or Wang Lang.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Belong to Sun Ce's Faction】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏司徒，王肃之父，王元姬祖父。汉末名士，擅长摇唇鼓舌。原为会稽太守，也曾拍马舞刀大战太史慈，与孙策交战战败后投奔曹操。曹操死后与华歆逼位献帝，靠此功绩升任司空。曹叡上位时代华歆成为司徒。诸葛亮北伐时推荐曹真并与其一同行军，与诸葛亮论战时气愤而死。","tc":"曹魏司徒，王肅之父，王元姬祖父。漢末名士，擅長搖唇鼓舌。原為會稽太守，也曾拍馬舞刀大戰太史慈，與孫策交戰戰敗后投奔曹操。曹操死后與華歆逼位獻帝，靠此功績升任司空。曹叡上位時代華歆成為司徒。諸葛亮北伐時推薦曹真并與其一同行軍，與諸葛亮論戰時氣憤而死。","en":"Senior Minister of Cao Wei, father of Wang Su and grandfather of Wang Yuanji. A famous late-Han scholar known for his eloquence. Originally Governor of Kuaiji, he once spurred his horse and brandished his saber to fight Taishi Ci. After his defeat by Sun Ce, he joined Cao Cao. After Cao Cao's death, he and Hua Xin pressured Emperor Xian to abdicate, earning promotion to Chief Minister on this merit. Under Cao Rui, he replaced Hua Xin as Senior Minister. When Zhuge Liang launched his Northern Expeditions, Wang Lang recommended Cao Zhen and accompanied him on the march. He died of rage during a verbal debate with Zhuge Liang.","jp":"曹魏の司徒。王粛の父、王元姫の祖父。後漢末期の名士であり、弁舌に長けていた。元は会稽太守を務め、かつては馬を駆り刀を振るって太史慈と打ち合ったこともあったが、孫策に敗れて曹操の元へと身を寄せた。曹操の死後は華歆と共に献帝に退位を迫り、その功績によって司空へと昇進。曹叡の即位後は華歆に代わって司徒となった。諸葛亮の北伐に際しては曹真を推挙して軍に同行したが、諸葛亮との論戦の末に憤死した。","kr":"조위의 사도이자 왕숙의 부친, 왕원희의 조부이다. 한말의 명사로 언변이 뛰어났다. 본래 회계태수였으며, 말을 몰고 도를 휘두르며 태사자와 대전을 벌이기도 했으나 손책과의 전투에서 패한 뒤 조조에게 의탁했다. 조조 사후 화흠과 함께 헌제를 핍박하여 제위에서 물러나게 했고, 이 공적으로 사공에 올랐다. 조예가 즉위한 후에는 화흠을 대신해 사도가 되었다. 제갈량이 북벌을 일으키자 조진을 추천하고 그와 동행하여 행군했으나, 제갈량과의 논전 도중 격분하여 죽었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10164","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"朗","nameTc":"朗","nameEn":"Lang","nameJp":"朗","nameKr":"랑","nameOther":"","word":"景兴","wordTc":"景興","wordEn":"Jingxing","wordJp":"景興","wordKr":"경흥","wordOther":"","icon":"王朗","power":"WJ10164","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1055","gender":"0","rule":"44","force":"70","wise":"77","politics":"83","charm":"55","will":"23","ruleTalent":"3","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"11","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"1","weaponMaster":"9/9/9/9/9/80/27/9","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1005505;1000801","warSoul":"S1000705","battleSoul":"1015605","debateSoul":"1003305","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"4900","debateSoulPoint":"5900","strategy":"1001801;1007315","strategy2":"1002205;1001405","professions":"1/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/2/3/0/0/0/3/0/1/3/3/0/2/0/0/1/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"22","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16000","evaluate":"-2000","title":"","rank":"5","birth":"162","show